<title>ESTONIA: HOIUPANK TO RELEASE PROFIT FORECAST ON AUG 6.</title>
<headline>HOIUPANK TO RELEASE PROFIT FORECAST ON AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank will release its revised 1997 profit forecast on August 6, Hoiupank said on Monday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bank said that it will also release its first-half consolidated financial results on the same day.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
